    {
      "id": "claim_009f73163044483d92ecca112960f7bc",
      "statement": "The reaper Lambda's unit tests mock handler.ecs and handler.ssm via patch and use an _exec_task fixture helper (enableExecuteCommand, containers with lastStatus/runtimeId) to cover session-protection scenarios: active-session protection, no-session stopping, no lookup on a future deadline, fail-closed SSM API errors isolated per task, multi-container protection, missing-runtimeId and missing/non-boolean enableExecuteCommand fail-closed cases, and an Active session detected on a later DescribeSessions page, alongside existing deadline-parsing, pagination, and stop-error coverage.",
